  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">reference to MADAR&apos;s new strategic plan MADAR&apos;s mission is to produce, publish and disseminate knowledge about all aspects of Israeli affairs for Palestinian and Arab decision makers and citizens. 
outcomes: 
1. adopting a participatory approach in determining priorities and analyzing the Israeli scene. 
2. enhancing the knoweldge of the instersted individuals and organization in Palestine and some Arab capitals about Israeli affairs.</narrative>
  </description>
